    "html": "\n  <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n    <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"3\">Level 3 - Intermediate</span><span class=\"time\">25 min</span>\n    <span class=\"chip warn\">Medium</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Graph traversal + hash map</span><span class=\"chip\">DFS / BFS</span>\n    <a class=\"chip\" href=\"https://leetcode.com/problems/clone-graph/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">LC 133</a>\n  </div>\n  <h1>Clone Graph</h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">Walk the graph once (DFS or BFS) and keep a map from each original node to its copy. Create the copy and put it in the map the moment you first see a node, before touching its neighbours; every later visit just returns the stored copy, which is what stops cycles. O(V + E) time, O(V) space.</p>\n"
  },
